{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32669","headline":"寓居寄友人 · 刘沧","name":"寓居寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨余虚馆竹阴清，独坐书窗轸旅情。\n芳草衡门无马迹，古槐深巷有蝉声。\n夕阳云尽嵩峰出，远岸烟消洛水平。\n今夜南原赏佳景，月高风定苦吟生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32669.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32669","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}